      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "しかしそこは、メタルエイリアンが潜む戦場と化していた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "6ed88283c30ee55ccd6f67a717232f6e29646f1dc119ff1333b3e15aecb147e4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "メタルエイリアンによって島中に散らばってしまった、\nエルフの宝珠の欠片を集めながら、\nエルフたちの住む集落を目指すが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "f530e7b29c39e694876ef45ea9b5a988a7fe01f3139d7457737e55bb197d5b9e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "메탈 에일리언 때문에 섬 곳곳에 흩어진\n엘프의 보주 조각을 모으면서\n엘프들이 사는 마을을 향하지만――.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 26,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "c365aa502cdd6da8fad7d85e90cde18ac15786d566e2ac1533939468a2a5263a:000000_-5060520169835310485:g0:r25",
      "row_index_0based": 25,
      "serialized_row_index": 25,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "メタルエイリアンによって島中に散らばってしまった、\nエルフの宝珠の欠片を集めながら、\nエルフたちの住む集落を目指すが――。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "337601a6912a44ca6fedb9308e5085d491904d5c93e22ff148ff932e7c0664e9",
